#: home/templates/home_page.html:22
msgid "Main Page Text"
msgstr ""
"Crimea needs your work, your creativity, and your initiative! Our peninsula "
"is home to intelligent, caring, and dedicated people capable of self-"
"organization. Even our coat of arms says: “Prosperity in unity.”\n"
"\n"
"Hromada Crimea will help you join a vast community of Crimeans who help each "
"other every day and build a system of collective action and decision-"
"making.\n"
"\n"
"Unite with those you live, study, and work with. Implement your own ideas. "
"Protect your peninsula from anyone who threatens the freedom of its people. "
"For yourself, for your land and people who live there, for your children and "
"grandchildren."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:23
msgid "Main Page Button"
msgstr "Take Action"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:41
msgid "Question 1"
msgstr "Why is Hromada Crimea needed?"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:43
msgid "Answer 1"
msgstr ""
"Hromada Crimea helps find inspiration and ideas, gives an opportunity to "
"join an existing initiative, and find performers or resources for your own "
"project. We are always ready to help with data or provide consultations. In "
"short, Hromada Crimea is a space where ideas and goals become possible to "
"realize. \n"
"\n"
"One of our tasks is to engage as many Crimeans as possible in civic "
"activities. We unite people and initiatives to create a grassroots self-"
"governance system in Crimea: a system that can collectively and efficiently "
"make decisions and act for the benefit of all Crimeans. With Hromada Crimea, "
"you can join this system and make your voice heard."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:47
msgid "Question 2"
msgstr "Why should I participate in this?"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:49
msgid "Answer 2"
msgstr ""
"A modern person often feels lonely and powerless to influence anything. It "
"creates a paradoxical situation: our future in a globalized world depends on "
"each other more than ever, but we are more disconnected than ever. In "
"Hromada Crimea, your voice will be heard. You will become part of a "
"community, and through it, you will directly influence the future of your "
"land and, consequently, your own future."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:53
msgid "Question 3"
msgstr "Nothing will change anyway."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:55
msgid "Answer 3"
msgstr ""
"We absolutely disagree with that! History knows countless examples where "
"smart, creative, and proactive citizens changed its course. Every day we see "
"participants in our movement setting goals and achieving them, and we see "
"how these small steps lead us to major changes. There are many of us, we are "
"a great force, and we directly influence the future of our land."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:59
msgid "Question 4"
msgstr "I don't have time for this. I need to focus on my own life."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:61
msgid "Answer 4"
msgstr ""
"You don’t need to spend much time on civic engagement. Below, you can choose "
"a task that will take only about 15 minutes to complete—faster than voting "
"in an election. Every small step you take is part of a bigger journey. "
"Participating in civic life is a sign of responsibility and awareness, "
"qualities essential for success in any area of life."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:65
msgid "Question 5"
msgstr "How is Hromada Crimea organized?"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:67
msgid "Answer 5"
msgstr ""
"Our movement is decentralized, meaning there is no 'center' or 'leadership.' "
"Hromada Crimea is governed by its participants, and anyone who shares our "
"common goal can become a member."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:71
msgid "Question 6"
msgstr "How can I participate?"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:73
msgid "Answer 6"
msgstr ""
"To become a member of our community, you simply need to create your own "
"initiative on our online platform or join an existing one. We will provide "
"any help we can: consultations, necessary data, connections with task "
"performers, and even financial and other resources for your initiative. "
"Below, you will find examples of tasks that take no more than 15 minutes to "
"complete."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:106
msgid "Why do our activists take part in Hromada?"
msgstr "Why do our activists take part in Hromada?"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:107
msgid "You can add your own reason to inspire others"
msgstr "You can add your own reason to inspire others"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:119
msgid "Your reason has been submitted for moderation"
msgstr "Your reason has been submitted for moderation"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:127
msgid "Task Section Heading"
msgstr "Take Action"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:131
msgid "Task Section Text"
msgstr ""
"Here, you can choose a task that resonates with you the most and commit to "
"completing it. Each of these tasks takes an average of about 15 minutes, but "
"this will be an important step forward because we are many, and together we "
"are a great force. You can choose as many tasks as you like, but we "
"recommend starting with one or two."

#: home/templates/home_page.html:139 home/templates/home_page.html:140
msgid "Task 1"
msgstr "Tell a friend about the Crimean Community"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:145 home/templates/home_page.html:146
msgid "Task 2"
msgstr "Post about the Crimean Community on your social media"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:151 home/templates/home_page.html:152
msgid "Task 3"
msgstr "Complete the survey below"

