#: home/templates/home_page.html:169 home/templates/home_page.html:170
msgid "Task 6"
msgstr ""
"Create a chat for neighbors, colleagues, or classmates (if one doesn’t exist "
"yet) and put up announcements in the building"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:175 home/templates/home_page.html:176
msgid "Task 7"
msgstr ""
"Attend a neighborhood meeting (or organize one) and work together to improve "
"or enrich community life"

#: home/templates/home_page.html:181 home/templates/home_page.html:182
